SOAPBOX: My first serious attempt at a sub-50 lb contest expedition.
SOAPBOX: Really enjoyed trying out 2 simple verticals near the water
SOAPBOX: at a cool location on the North shore of Crete.
SOAPBOX: First was a POTA performer on the beach for 20 through 10 M.
SOAPBOX: The other was a vertical wire on a Spiderbeam pole
SOAPBOX: with elevated radials for 40 and 15, about 20 ft from the water's edge.
SOAPBOX: Thanks to everyone who copied my puny signal and ridiculously long and confusing call.
SOAPBOX: Heard much that was exotic and rare for a qrp op from Southern Ontario.
SOAPBOX: Can't wait to do it again next year.
SOAPBOX: Tom
